(Article 412. The amount of the penalty clause may not exceed the) '
(value of the main obligation.) '
() '
(Article 416. To demand the penalty clause, the creditor does not need) '
(to prove any loss. Sole paragraph: even if the loss exceeds the penalty,) '
(the creditor may not demand supplementary compensation unless the) '
(contract expressly allows it; in that case the penalty counts as the) '
(minimum compensation, and the creditor must prove the additional loss.) '
() '
(Article 475. The party injured by non-performance may request the) '
(termination of the contract, if it does not prefer to demand) '
(performance, and in either case may claim losses and damages.) '
